('127.511.d.6.A',3,'A hearing test that presents tones at different frequencies to find the softest sounds a person can hear is called:','["pure-tone audiometry", "x-ray", "tympanometry", "otoscopy"]'::jsonb,0,'Audiometry.','original'),
