('127.511.d.6.B',3,'A basic hearing screening checks whether a person responds to tones at a set level, such as 20 or 25:','["hertz", "pounds", "decibels", "degrees"]'::jsonb,2,'Screening level.','original'),
('127.511.d.6.B',4,'Before screening, the clinician checks the ear canal with an otoscope to look for:','["weight", "eye color", "height", "blockage"]'::jsonb,3,'Otoscopy.','original'),
