('127.511.d.6.E',3,'A diagnostic report should include the reason for referral, case history, test results, and:','["recommendations", "jokes", "songs", "recipes"]'::jsonb,0,'Report components.','original'),
('127.511.d.6.E',4,'The part of a report that tells the reader the clinician''s conclusion about the findings is the:','["date", "impression", "title", "address"]'::jsonb,1,'Impression.','original'),
('127.511.d.7.A',3,'Evidence-based practice combines research evidence, clinical expertise, and client:','["secrets", "weight", "preferences", "pay"]'::jsonb,2,'EBP.','original'),
('127.511.d.7.A',4,'Scientific research is one part of evidence-based practice but EBP also uses the clinician''s experience and the client''s:','["height", "age only", "weight", "values"]'::jsonb,3,'EBP is broader than research.','original'),
('127.511.d.7.B',3,'The American Speech-Language-Hearing Association rates the strength of research using evidence:','["levels", "colors", "flavors", "prices"]'::jsonb,0,'Evidence levels.','original'),
('127.511.d.7.B',4,'Studies with a stronger design, such as randomized trials, receive a higher level of:','["humor", "evidence", "noise", "color"]'::jsonb,1,'Stronger designs rank higher.','original'),
