('127.511.d.8.C',3,'A voice treatment that teaches a client to reduce vocal strain and use healthy habits is called vocal function and vocal:','["hygiene", "shopping", "fashion", "decor"]'::jsonb,0,'Voice treatment.','original'),
('127.511.d.8.C',4,'Practicing resonant voice exercises in therapy is an example of voice treatment in a:','["kitchen", "clinical setting", "parking lot", "stadium"]'::jsonb,1,'Practice in settings.','original'),
('127.511.d.8.D',3,'Preschool language treatment often uses game-like, parent-involved methods because young children learn best through games and:','["lectures", "homework", "play", "tests"]'::jsonb,2,'Preschool approach.','original'),
