('127.554.d.1.A',3,'Speaking clearly and concisely is an example of effective:','["denial", "hesitation", "communication", "avoidance"]'::jsonb,2,'Clear communication.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.A',4,'A nonverbal behavior such as crossing your arms can send a message of being:','["welcoming", "happy", "hungry", "closed off"]'::jsonb,3,'Nonverbal messages.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.B',3,'Information about a patient should be reported accurately and according to facility:','["policies", "jokes", "styles", "rumors"]'::jsonb,0,'Reporting.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.B',4,'A health care worker should report an observation at once if a patient''s condition is:','["unchanged", "changing", "funny", "pleasant"]'::jsonb,1,'Prompt reports.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.C',3,'Therapeutic communication with more fluency means speaking with more ease and:','["doubt", "anger", "confidence", "delay"]'::jsonb,2,'Fluent therapeutic communication.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.C',4,'Responding to a frightened patient with a calm voice and reassurance is an example of therapeutic:','["competition", "confusion", "avoidance", "communication"]'::jsonb,3,'Therapeutic.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.D',3,'To communicate data to a team, the worker must first analyze and:','["interpret it", "ignore it", "hide it", "delete it"]'::jsonb,0,'Analyze and interpret.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.D',4,'Using charts and graphs can help a worker communicate observations and data more:','["slowly", "clearly", "secretly", "loudly"]'::jsonb,1,'Visuals clarify.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.E',3,'Looking at the speaker, asking questions, and restating what you heard are parts of the communication skill known as active:','["reading", "speaking", "listening", "writing"]'::jsonb,2,'Active listening.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.E',4,'Asking ''Can you tell me more about that?'' is a way to clarify:','["weather", "clothing", "music", "information"]'::jsonb,3,'Clarify.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.F',3,'A patient who grimaces and holds his side may be showing a nonverbal cue of:','["pain", "sleep", "hunger", "happiness"]'::jsonb,0,'Nonverbal cues.','original'),
('127.554.d.1.F',4,'A patient who says ''I''m fine'' but looks worried shows that words and nonverbal cues may:','["be silent", "not match", "be identical", "always match"]'::jsonb,1,'Interpret cues.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.A',3,'Following workplace safety rules such as wearing protective equipment protects both workers and:','["vendors", "visitors", "patients", "managers only"]'::jsonb,2,'Safety rules.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.A',4,'The federal agency that sets workplace safety rules in the United States is:','["EPA", "CDC", "FDA", "OSHA"]'::jsonb,3,'OSHA.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.B',3,'Using standard precautions consistently means doing so for every patient, every:','["time", "year", "week", "month"]'::jsonb,0,'Consistency.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.B',4,'Using a mechanical lift to move a patient who cannot bear weight follows safe patient:','["billing", "handling", "coding", "scheduling"]'::jsonb,1,'Safe handling.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.C',3,'Before using a hazardous chemical, a worker looks at the safety data sheet, which is required to be kept:','["locked away", "hidden", "accessible", "discarded"]'::jsonb,2,'SDS access.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.C',4,'A safety data sheet includes first aid measures, storage instructions, and information about:','["fashions", "colors", "prices", "hazards"]'::jsonb,3,'SDS contents.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.D',3,'Wearing gloves and washing hands are examples of infection:','["control", "growth", "music", "decor"]'::jsonb,0,'Infection control.','original'),
('127.554.d.3.D',4,'Using proper lifting posture prevents injuries to the worker''s:','["teeth", "back", "eyes", "ears"]'::jsonb,1,'Body mechanics.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.A',3,'Arriving on time and completing assigned tasks shows a positive work:','["trouble", "habit of absence", "ethic", "delay"]'::jsonb,2,'Work ethic.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.A',4,'Completing assigned tasks as directed shows reliability and a:','["weak work ethic", "poor habit", "lack of focus", "strong work ethic"]'::jsonb,3,'Productive work.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.B',3,'Following laws and professional codes shows adherence to ethical and legal:','["standards", "trends", "rumors", "jokes"]'::jsonb,0,'Ethical and legal standards.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.B',4,'Respecting a patient''s right to privacy under HIPAA is an example of following a legal:','["hobby", "standard", "rumor", "fashion"]'::jsonb,1,'HIPAA.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.C',3,'Telling the truth about a mistake, even though it may cause trouble, shows:','["cowardice", "speed", "integrity", "luck"]'::jsonb,2,'Integrity.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.C',4,'Choosing the ethical course of action when making decisions is a sign of professional:','["speed", "fashion", "luck", "integrity"]'::jsonb,3,'Ethical decisions.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.D',3,'A health care worker must comply with all rules, laws, and:','["regulations", "games", "fashions", "rumors"]'::jsonb,0,'Compliance.','original'),
('127.554.d.4.D',4,'Following facility policy every time, not just when supervised, is complying in a consistent:','["moment", "manner", "month", "mood"]'::jsonb,1,'Consistent compliance.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.A',3,'A supervised health science experience, such as a clinical rotation, requires students to document and evaluate their learning:','["lunches", "pets", "activities", "hobbies"]'::jsonb,2,'Supervised experience.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.A',4,'Keeping a log of skills practiced during clinical hours helps a student evaluate what was:','["wasted", "hidden", "lost", "learned"]'::jsonb,3,'Documenting learning.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.B',3,'A student who wants to become a surgical technologist builds technical skills related to a personal occupational:','["objective", "vacation", "accident", "hobby"]'::jsonb,0,'Occupational objective.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.B',4,'Advanced technical knowledge is gained through study and hands-on:','["sleep", "practice", "delay", "rest"]'::jsonb,1,'Technical development.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.C',3,'Identifying where you do well and where you need to improve is evaluating your strengths and:','["hobbies", "friends", "weaknesses", "pets"]'::jsonb,2,'Self-evaluation.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.C',4,'After identifying a weakness in a skill, a student should create a plan to:','["hide the weakness", "quit", "avoid the skill", "practice and improve"]'::jsonb,3,'Improvement plan.','original'),
('127.554.d.6.D',3,'A collection of examples of a student''s work is called a:','["portfolio", "calendar", "lunch box", "yearbook"]'::jsonb,0,'Work samples.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
